{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19734","headline":"道州观野火 · 吕温","name":"道州观野火","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南风吹烈火，焰焰烧楚泽。\n阳景当昼迟，阴天半夜赤。\n过处若彗扫，来时如电激。\n岂复辨萧兰，焉能分玉石。\n虫蛇尽烁烂，虎兕出奔迫。\n积秽一荡除，和气始融液。\n尧时既敬授，禹稼斯肇迹。\n遍生合颖禾，大秀两岐麦。\n家有京坻咏，人无沟壑戚。\n乃悟焚如功，来岁终受益。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}